SUMMARY:BEAST IN BLACK\, RESURRECTION TOUR 2026\, Support: FROZEN CROWN + Special Guest: SONATA ARTICA
DESCRIPTION:Beast In Black is a Helsinki-based international heavy metal band whose sound fuses powerful riffs with melodic hooks\, dance-metal energy\, and the drama of 1980s pop and electronic music. Known for their explosive live shows\, the band has released three acclaimed albums\, a string of singles and videos\, and even a high-profile collaboration with Blizzard Entertainment’s Diablo IV and Berserk\, tied to the game’s eighth season Belial’s Return\, releasing the single “Enter The Behelit” as its soundtrack.\nBeast In Black show no signs of slowing down. In June 2024 they released the standalone single “Power Of The Beast”\, described by Kabanen as the band’s first “Super Eurobeast” anthem. Later that year they were confirmed as special guests on Helloween’s 40th anniversary European tour in autumn 2025.\nBeast in Black are hitting the road again! In 2026\, the band will embark on a massive European and UK tour in support of their highly anticipated fourth studio album. Joining them on this epic run are Sonata Arctica and Frozen Crown.\nGet ready for a night of pure metal power!
LOCATION:Columbiahalle\, Columbiadamm 13-21\, 10965 Berlin
GEO:52.4845171;13.3905217
URL;VALUE=URI:http://www.columbiahalle.berlin/de#event_8499
END:VEVENT
